d anchor --></a>\n\t\t16,474,101\n\t\t</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p id=\"idm45818456881864\"><a href=\"#keer_2021_202_93_T8\" class=\"bt_fn link_blue\" name=\"bibrLink\">&lt;표 8&gt;</a>은 <a href=\"#keer_2021_202_93_r25\" class=\"bt_fn link_blue\" name=\"bibrLink\">한국에너지공단(2020)</a>에서 발표한 2019년 기준 차종별 유종별 연비 및 전비를 정리한 것이다. 자동차 주행거리를 차종별, 용도별, 유종별 구분에 맞게 정리해보았다. 다만 승합과 화물차의 전비는 국내 자동차 회사에서 출시하고 있는 전기차(승합 및 화물) 정보를 활용하여 추정하였다.<sup><a href=\"#keer_2021_202_93_pfn8\" class=\"bt_fn link_blue\" name=\"bibrLink\">8)</a></sup></p><div class=\"table-wrap panel\"><a id=\"keer_2021_202_93_T8\" class=\"anchor\"><!-- named anchor --></a><h5 class=\"label xxx2\">&lt;표 8&gt;</h5><div class=\"caption\"><h4 class=\"subsection-title\">차종별 연료별 연비(전비)(단위:km/ℓ, km/kWh)</h4></div><table><a id=\"idm45818467828424\" class=\"anchor\"><!-- named anchor --></a><tbody><a id=\"idm45818467828168\" class=\"anchor\"><!-- named anchor --></a><tr><a id=\"idm45818462606600\" class=\"anchor\"><!-- named anchor --></a><td><a id=\"idm45818462606344\" class=\"anchor\"><!-- named anchor --></a>\n\t\t차종\n\t\t</td><td><a id=\"idm45818462605912\" class=\"anchor\"><!-- named anchor --></a>\n\t\t유종\n\t\t</td><td><a id=\"idm45818462605480\" class=\"anchor\"><!-- named anchor --></a>\n\t\t연비/전비\n\t\t</td></tr><tr><a id=\"idm45818464988008\" class=\"anchor\"><!-- named anchor --></a><td rowspan=\"3\" align=\"center\"><a id=\"idm45818464987752\" class=\"anchor\"><!-- named anchor --></a>\n\t\t승용\n\t\t</td><td><a id=\"idm45818464986840\" class=\"anchor\"><!-- named anchor --></a>\n\t\t휘발유\n\t\t</td><td><a id=\"idm45818465318536\" class=\"anchor\"><!-- named anchor --></a>\n\t\t11.77\n\t\t</td></tr><tr><a id=\"idm45818465318024\" class=\"anchor\"><!-- named anchor --></a><td><a id=\"idm45818465317768\" class=\"anchor\"><!-- named anchor --></a>\n\t\t경유\n\t\t</td><td><a id=\"idm45818461862712\" class=\"anchor\"><!-- named anchor --></a>\n\t\t12.64\n\t\t</td></tr><tr><a id=\"idm45818461862200\" class=\"anchor\"><!